msgstr "WooCommerce 주문 알림"

#: includes/class-sendgo-settings.php:117
msgid "[Order completed] Alimtalk template code"
msgstr "[주문 완료] 알림톡 템플릿 코드"

#: includes/class-sendgo-settings.php:118
msgid "[Order completed] SMS text used if Alimtalk fails"
msgstr "[주문 완료] 알림톡 실패 시 대체 문자 내용"

#: includes/class-sendgo-settings.php:119
